##  Food Ordering payment architecture

                    FOOD ORDERING APP
                           │
          ┌────────────────┴────────────────┐
          │                                 │
       FRONTEND                          BACKEND
       React                            Express
          │                                 │
          │ Create Order                    │
          ├────────────────────────────────→│
          │                                 │
          │                          Create DB Order
          │                                 │
          │                          Create PaymentIntent
          │                                 │
          │←──────── clientSecret ──────────┤
          │                                 │
    Stripe Elements                         │
          │                                 │
          │ confirmPayment()                │
          ├───────────────────────────────→ Stripe
          │                                 │
          │                          Payment processing
          │                                 │
          │                                 │
          │                       payment_intent.succeeded
          │                                 │
          │                                 ▼
          │                           Stripe CLI
          │                                 │
          │                                 │ forward
          │                                 ▼
          │                           Webhook API
          │                                 │
          │                                 ▼
          │                          Verify signature
          │                                 │
          │                                 ▼
          │                           Update PostgreSQL
          │                                 │
          │                          paymentStatus=PAID
          │                                 │
          │←──── redirect to success ───────┤
          │
          ▼
   PaymentSuccess
          │
          ▼
      Clear Cart
          │
          ▼
       Orders


## Complete flow :

                 CUSTOMER
                    │
                    ▼
                  CART
                    │
                    │ POST /orders
                    ▼
               EXPRESS API
                    │
                    ├──────→ PostgreSQL
                    │          Create Order
                    │
                    ▼
                  STRIPE
                    │
                    │ Create PaymentIntent
                    ▼
               PaymentIntent
                    │
                    │ client_secret
                    ▼
               EXPRESS API
                    │
                    ▼
                REACT
                    │
                    ▼
             Stripe Elements
                    │
                    │ confirmPayment()
                    ▼
                  STRIPE
                    │
                    │ payment succeeds
                    ▼
        ┌─────────────────────────┐
        │ payment_intent.succeeded│
        └────────────┬────────────┘
                     │
                     ▼
                STRIPE CLI
                     │
                     │ forward
                     ▼
        localhost:5001/api/payments/webhook
                     │
                     ▼
             Webhook Controller
                     │
                     ▼
          Webhook Service
                     │
                     ▼
                PostgreSQL
                     │
                     ▼
          paymentStatus = PAID


        At the same time : 

          Stripe
            │
            │ return_url
            ▼
            Browser
            │
            ▼
            PaymentSuccess.tsx
            │
            ▼
            Show "Payment Successful"

## So what exactly is Stripe CLI?
## Stripe CLI is a development bridge that receives Stripe webhook events and forwards them to your local backend.


# Install ESLint in the backend : npm install --save-dev eslint @eslint/js typescript-eslint

Package	Purpose
eslint	The linting engine that analyzes our code.
@eslint/js	Provides ESLint's recommended rules for JavaScript.
typescript-eslint	Provides TypeScript support and recommended TypeScript linting rules.
